    "title": "Spaced Repetition: How It Works and How to Use It",
    "question": "Does spaced repetition really work, and how do I use it?",
    "summary": "Spaced repetition is a scientifically validated learning technique that schedules information reviews at increasing intervals to maximize long-term retention. This article explains the cognitive science behind it and provides a practical guide on how to implement it using tools like Anki.",
